    {
      "text": "Jon Cryer's ring vanished in rain.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "hook"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Jon Cryer was in Vancouver, filming Supergirl.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "real",
        "src": "434-jon-cryer-s-ring-vanished-in-rain-0.jpg",
        "fit": "card",
        "label": "Vancouver seawall",
        "credit": "Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One rainy night, he pulled his hand from his pocket.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "ring",
        "stone": "peridot",
        "cut": "oval",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "A rainy night"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He heard a ping, and his wedding ring was gone.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "A ping",
        "sub": "In the rain",
        "piece": "brooch",
        "stone": "emerald",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "cut": "round",
        "petals": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A search by phone flashlight found nothing.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "earrings",
        "stone": "citrine",
        "cut": "round",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "A phone flashlight"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Next morning he saw a glint, which was a pair of glasses.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "necklace",
        "stone": "aquamarine",
        "cut": "round",
        "metal": "platinum",
        "label": "Just a pair of glasses"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So he posted on Craigslist and found a ring finding service.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "bracelet",
        "stone": "topaz",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "The Ring Finders"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A man named Chris Turner came with a metal detector.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "brooch",
        "stone": "citrine",
        "cut": "round",
        "petals": 8,
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "A metal detector"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Turner said the odds were about five percent.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "5 percent",
        "sub": "The odds",
        "piece": "necklace",
        "stone": "ruby",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "cut": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Within minutes, the ring turned up in the grass.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "stone",
        "stone": "peridot",
        "cut": "cushion",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "In the grass"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cryer shared the whole saga in a Twitter thread.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "eternity",
        "stone": "sapphire",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "stones": 10,
        "label": "A Twitter thread"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The ring lay three yards from the glasses.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "ring",
        "stone": "diamond",
        "cut": "round",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "Three yards away"
      },
      "hold": 0.7
