  "post": {
    "caption": "Jon Cryer's ring vanished in rain. While filming Supergirl in Vancouver, Jon Cryer pulled his hand from his pocket on a rainy night, heard a ping, and his wedding ring was gone. A phone flashlight search found nothing, and the glint he saw next morning was a pair of glasses. He posted on Craigslist and found a ring finding service. Chris Turner came with a metal detector and put the odds at about five percent, but within minutes the ring turned up in the grass. Cryer told the saga in a Twitter thread in October 2020. The ring lay three yards from the glasses.",
